I would check to make sure that the 3rd covariate 1) exists in the data set
and 2) is not empty.  Try summary(data.set.name).  If the 3rd covariate is
binary (0,1), it could well be that there are no 1s (or no 0s) in either the
treatment or control groups, which leads to poor fits in the logit.


